        "id": "AC-1",
        "text": "`/users?id=1` and `/users` both match `/users`. [D-049]",
        "checked": true,
        "line": 636
      },
      {
        "id": "AC-2",
        "text": "Under the default policy `/Users` and `/users/` do not match `/users`, and `/users/` matches only a pattern registered as `/users/`. [D-050]",
        "checked": true,
        "line": 637
      },
      {
        "id": "AC-3",
        "text": "`/files/%252e` matched against `/files/:name` yields `name` = `%2e`, and `/caf%C3%A9` matches the literal pattern `/café`. [D-051] [SDS 2026-10-19.naruserve.naruserve-v1-wave-2-2 SDS-AC-8] Each segment is decoded %XX exactly once as UTF-8 and '+' stays '+'.",
        "checked": true,
        "line": 638
      },
      {
        "id": "AC-4",
        "text": "Under the default policy `/a//b` matches neither `/a/:x/b` nor `/a/b` and reaches the no-match result when no other pattern matches. [wave decision: path-form policy]",
        "checked": true,
        "line": 639
      }
    ],
